graph TD
    Start([Mulai: Request Generate PRD]) --> LoadSettings[Ambil system_settings & Kunci API]
    LoadSettings --> CheckUserSlot{User Punya Assigned Slot?}
    
    CheckUserSlot -- Ya --> PinSlot[Gunakan Kunci Slot Khusus User] --> InitLadder
    CheckUserSlot -- Tidak --> CheckGlobalSlot{Global Slot Aktif?}
    CheckGlobalSlot -- Ya --> PinGlobal[Gunakan Kunci Global Pilihan] --> InitLadder
    CheckGlobalSlot -- Tidak --> RoundRobin[Load Balancing Round-Robin Slot Aktif] --> InitLadder

    InitLadder[Inisialisasi Model Ladder:<br/>gemini-3.8-flash -> gemini-3.5-flash -> gemini-flash-latest -> gemini-2.5-flash]
    InitLadder --> StartModelLoop[Pilih Model Teratas dalam Ladder]
    
    StartModelLoop --> ExecFetch[Kirim Request REST API generateContent]
    ExecFetch --> EvalResp{Status HTTP?}
    
    EvalResp -- 200 OK --> ValidateZod{Lolos Validasi Zod Schema?}
    ValidateZod -- Valid --> FinishSuccess([Sukses: Kembalikan PRD Lengkap])
    ValidateZod -- Gagal Parse --> NextAttempt
    
    EvalResp -- 429 Rate Limit --> MarkCooldown[Tandai Kunci Cooldown 60 Detik] --> TryNextKey[Coba Kunci Berikutnya di Pool]
    TryNextKey --> ExecFetch

    EvalResp -- Error Lainnya / 503 --> NextAttempt{Masih Ada Model di Ladder?}
    NextAttempt -- Ya --> ShiftModel[Turun ke Model Berikutnya di Ladder] --> StartModelLoop
    NextAttempt -- Tidak --> TriggerFallback[Eksekusi Domain Fallback Fast Generator]
    TriggerFallback --> FinishSuccess
